OL,3,GNEWSALisburn manufacturer to create 100
OL,4,Ajobs
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Lisburn-based engineering firm is
OL,7,Fcreating 100 jobs as part of a #20m
OL,8,Finvestment.
OL,10,FIt is the first stage of a planned
OL,11,Fexpansion since Camlin was taken over
OL,12,Fby Siemens Energy earlier this year.
OL,14,FChief Executive Peter Cunningham said
OL,15,Fthe move was "a powerful statement of
OL,16,Fconfidence in Northern Ireland, our
OL,17,Fpeople and our technology".
OL,19,FHe said his ambition was to create a
OL,20,Fbusiness on the scale of Almac, the
OL,21,FCraigavon-based pharmaceutical firm
OL,22,Fwhich has annual sales of over #1bn.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
